                "message": "Add sp-dg-positions: position graph, status views and rules for discourse-graphs\n\nAdds a custom module with an outline, a Graphviz graph, per-status views,\na gaps view and a check view over discourse-graphs nodes, driven by one\nreadable rule list (node types, relations, statuses, gaps). Documents the\nstates of research questions, replacing the single CONTESTED state with a\ncomputed status on each answer.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KPtqz2rJ4M5MmMAbr8fu1U",
